    "description": "The data set represents the monitoring stations where the water status is recorded. The cantons are responsible for water protection enforcement, as they are for other environmentally relevant aspects, and perform most of the water analyses. The Federal Government's role is limited to analyses of national relevance. The cantonal and federal data are collected in the Water Condition Database (DBGZ) held by the Federal Office for the Environment (FOEN).",
